{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Guards vs Goats",
    "steam_appid": 3348120,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a long forgotten kingdom, a hero is sent to rescue a princess from an evil lord's castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What can go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guards vs Goats is a linear first-person-shooter with swords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has stealth, it has action, it is story driven and... a bit silly. Just a bit...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, in a forgotten land, in a forgotten era, there was a kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom was living in peace and prosperity. A peace and prosperity which made the lords of the realm bored and greedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When blood and war against neighboring kingdoms was lacking in their daily lives, the lords decided to fight among themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Times like these called for a hero. A different kind of a hero...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as William, also know as a mercenary who goes by the name &quot;Goat&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >William is not the strongest, sharpest, bravest of all, but he does get the job done. Problem is, he may cause a bigger mess while at it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be summoned by the lords of the realm to perform their &quot;lordly&quot; tasks in return of\u00a0 some gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person, linear, half action, half stealth playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic game pace in the story playthrough, consisting of different modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slower paced dungeon crawling mode, where you explore castles and dungeons while choosing to use stealth or strength to progress through the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast paced horde mode where you  fight your way out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape scenarios where fighting is futile and you just need to run away as fast as you can.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selectable sword-fight mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good old hack &amp; slash, where every strike is a hit, but damage varies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing based combat, where you or your enemy can fully block attacks if timed correctly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timed + Directional combat, where in addition to perfect timing, you'll need to strike and block in the correct direction based on your opponent's action.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 chapters of story driven gameplay, spanning in 6 different locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aside from the story, you'll have the ability to create your own custom chapter according to the following rules:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each completed castle, or castle section will be unlocked to be playable in the custom chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the characters you meet in the story will be selectable in the custom chapters. Characters such as princesses to rescue, sidekicks to join your side and lords to have one on one duels against.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different missions to select from:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue the princess.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the treasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot a defined amount of gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer the castle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items you find in story mode, such as gold and arrows, can be used in custom chapters.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give chapter 1 a try.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a long forgotten kingdom, a hero is sent to rescue a princess from an evil lord's castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What can go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guards vs Goats is a linear first-person-shooter with swords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has stealth, it has action, it is story driven and... a bit silly. Just a bit...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, in a forgotten land, in a forgotten era, there was a kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom was living in peace and prosperity. A peace and prosperity which made the lords of the realm bored and greedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When blood and war against neighboring kingdoms was lacking in their daily lives, the lords decided to fight among themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Times like these called for a hero. A different kind of a hero...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as William, also know as a mercenary who goes by the name &quot;Goat&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >William is not the strongest, sharpest, bravest of all, but he does get the job done. Problem is, he may cause a bigger mess while at it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be summoned by the lords of the realm to perform their &quot;lordly&quot; tasks in return of\u00a0 some gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person, linear, half action, half stealth playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic game pace in the story playthrough, consisting of different modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slower paced dungeon crawling mode, where you explore castles and dungeons while choosing to use stealth or strength to progress through the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast paced horde mode where you  fight your way out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape scenarios where fighting is futile and you just need to run away as fast as you can.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selectable sword-fight mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good old hack &amp; slash, where every strike is a hit, but damage varies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing based combat, where you or your enemy can fully block attacks if timed correctly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timed + Directional combat, where in addition to perfect timing, you'll need to strike and block in the correct direction based on your opponent's action.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 chapters of story driven gameplay, spanning in 6 different locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aside from the story, you'll have the ability to create your own custom chapter according to the following rules:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each completed castle, or castle section will be unlocked to be playable in the custom chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the characters you meet in the story will be selectable in the custom chapters. Characters such as princesses to rescue, sidekicks to join your side and lords to have one on one duels against.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different missions to select from:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue the princess.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the treasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot a defined amount of gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer the castle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items you find in story mode, such as gold and arrows, can be used in custom chapters.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give chapter 1 a try.</p>",
    "short_description": "In a long forgotten kingdom, a hero sent to rescue a princess from an evil lord's castle. What can go wrong? Guards vs Goats is a first-person, linear, medieval FPS, with a touch of humor.",
